					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400310506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "龍二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400310506,
					"content": "…話雖如此，不過平時一般也不會同時有這麼多小動物走失就是了。這個事件，無論怎麼說都很不尋常呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400310507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "龍二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400310507,
					"content": "早些時候，我還循著蹤跡在別的地方，發現了被困住的小動物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400310508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "龍二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400310508,
					"content": "還需要「潛入」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400310509
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400310509,
					"content": "這次不用了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400310510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "龍二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400310510,
					"content": "#放心，依{F#妳}{M#你}的身法來看，應該不是什麼難纏的對手，到了{F#妳}{M#你}就知道了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "龍二"
				}
			]
